Hi Altuna,

I have used methylKitR for the promoter analysis. Please let me know the following regarding this:
-i) One method is that I can just take input the whole genome files and then can give the promoter bed file so that the program will filterout all the CpGs within the promoter boundaries and will perform the analysis on them
-ii) Second method that I can give input with promoter files (already clustered all the CpGs into promoter boundaries).

In both the cases, will the software give different results?

Many thanks in anticipation of your quick reply,

Shalu

