Hi Altuna,

Thank you for your kind replies. I am trying to figure out the problem of mismatches of the promoters and I found some strange observations. I used same annotation from two different file formats for promoter analysis:
i) methylKit (.bed format attched mm9 annotation)
ii) my promoters (UCSC all entries in the file: tab delimited file with all information:UCSC_to_Ensemble_map.txt ). Both contains same no. of lines and are from same source, just format change.

Please see below:
Steps:

i)gene.obj=read.transcript.features("/users/GD/resource/mouse/mm9/annotation/genes/UCSC_annotation.bed", down.flank=100)
a<-as.data.frame(gene.obj$promoters)
